    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The failure to recruit and maintain adequate levels of personnel in the health care industry-- and the related failure to reach political agreement on the levels and distribution of funding for health care services--has reached disastrous levels. In this report, many elements of the staffing crisis receive specific attention, including the difficulties of the long-term care sector, the capacity of our health care system to respond to emergencies, the rapid escalation of health care premiums, and etc. The report is part the \"Jobs with a Future\" series, developed and published jointly with the Silicon Valley Workforce Investment Network.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Louise Auerhahn, Bob Brownstein, Sarah Zimmerman ; prepared by Working Partnerships USA.",
            "type": "statement of responsibility",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Includes bibliographical references (pages 30-31).",
            "type": "bibliography",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
